        skos:definition        "The DTG3 is a mini observation-class underwater ROV video camera. It has a 1080p camera with upgrade up to 4k available. 75 m tether with options up to 700 m available. 200 m depth rating. Operating temperature -10 to 50 degrees C."@en;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/SDNDEV/current/>;
