        skos:definition        "Originally had a 10.1 cm diameter mouth opening expanding to 17.8 cm diameter main body. Overall length 91.4 cm.  In modified form with 3.8 cm diameter aperture opening, 7.6 cm diameter filter disc, 56 cm overall length, and with depressor and stabilizing fins.  Normal towing speed 8 knots [Wiebe and Benfield 2003 Plate 13 D,E]."@en;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/SDNDEV/current/>;
        skos:notation          "SDN:L22::NETT0154";
