        skos:definition        "A brass cylinder 6 cm diameter and 6 cm long with bridle attachment lugs that had a 180 cm bolting cloth net (16 or 30 meshes per cm) attached to the back [Wiebe and Benfield 2003 Plate 18 A ]."@en;
